WEBVTT

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.360
to the person who murdered your child?

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.336
I tell them, you do that
through forgiveness.

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:07.496
As it's evident it worked for me.

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:09.416
It worked for my family.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:12.096
What's a miracle is it worked for Tony,

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.256
it worked for his family,

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:17.496
it can work for you and your family,

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:20.496
for Israel and Palestine,
North and South Korea,

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:23.376
for Iraq, Afghanistan, Iran and Syria.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.000
It can work for
the United States of America.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.936
So let me leave you with this, my sisters,

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.296
and a couple of brothers --